    "title": "Traveller Watch face",
    "description": "Guys you should also really check out Illuminator Digital Watch face!\r\n\r\nIlluminator Digital: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=wb.illuminator.digital\r\n\r\nLove to travel? Have relatives, friends and/or business partners around the world? \r\nNow it's easier for them to know what's their time. Just a quick glance at your watch tells you the hour in their timezone!\r\n\r\nCombined with several background/hands color themes, you have the ultimate Time zone watch for Wear OS and for FREE!!! Enjoy!\r\n\r\nCheck out other very beautiful and functional watch faces:\r\n\r\nLuna Benedicta - https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=wb.luna.benedicta\r\nModern Classic - https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=wb.modern.classic\r\nVictory - https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=wb.victory.tourbillon\r\nVictory x Carbon - https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=wb.victorycarbon.full\r\nWatchBase. illuminator - https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=wb.illuminator.hybrid",
